# Live checks using the VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
# Set these public deployment URLs; no passwords or tokens are needed.
# Application adapters sign the trusted client IP server-side.
@appUrl = https://YOUR_APP
@gatewayUrl = https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co/functions/v1/gateway

### Public restroom search through the signed-IP adapter
GET {{appUrl}}/api/restrooms?lat=39.9526&lon=-75.1652&radius=1500

### ZIP search through the adapter
GET {{appUrl}}/api/restrooms?zip=40385&radius=1500

### Expected 403: direct gateway calls lack a signed-IP assertion
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/places/bathrooms?lat=39.9526&lon=-75.1652&radius=1500

### Expected 200: preflights bypass quota and do not call a backend
OPTIONS {{gatewayUrl}}/places/bathrooms
Origin: {{appUrl}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

# Legacy /accounts/*, /admin/access, /admin/login, /admin/create-password
# and /health no longer exist. With a trusted assertion they return 404;
# unsigned direct requests still return 403 before route matching.
# Use the application's Supabase magic-link flow for contribution/dashboard
# sign-in; /frontend/auth/v1/logout is separate from legacy JWT /auth/logout.
